1
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:09,850
The Texas is entering its final battle.

2
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,600
Prepare to fire the Dover Cannon!

3
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:14,200
What?!

4
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,050
Get out of there, Captain!

5
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,150
Hurry up!

6
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:21,450
I'm counting on you all.

7
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:25,350
The enemy ship is charging us!

8
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:26,650
Destroy it!

9
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:28,800
Keep it away from the Dragon Turtle!

10
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:32,500
It's no use!

11
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,800
We're going to collide!

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,500
Captain!

13
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,650
Dover Cannon... fire!
